{:frontmatter
 {:id "adr-2607022300-actor-deploy-3-substrate-topology"
  :title "ADR-2607022300: actor deploy 3-substrate topology — kotoba=storage / murakumo=compute / aozora=publish + unified e7m actor CLI"
  :status "accepted"
  :doc_type "adr"
  :topic "substrate-architecture"
  :authoritative true
  :last_verified "2026-07-02"
  :authoritative_for
  ["3 substrate は対等な deploy 先でなく、storage/compute/publish の3関心事。aozora は compute 基盤でなく publish 先+identity 登録場所"
   "依存は厳密レイヤリング: author → kotoba → {murakumo|browser-WASM} → aozora。循環なし。3登録は互いに独立(idempotent)"
   "bb e7m(ADR-2606222000)の下に 3 facet を1名詞で統合: e7m actor {mesh, pin(kotoba), reside(murakumo), identify(aozora), deploy --all}。既存 aozora:deploy=identify, kotobase:pin=pin, murakumo:deploy=reside のリネーム統合"
   "2 実行会場(browser-WASM=user主権 / murakumo kototama=communal 常駐)はどちらも kotoba から具現化し aozora へ publish。venue が署名帰属を分ける"]
  :related
  ["90-docs/adr/2606222000-bb-e7m-cli-consolidation.md"
   "90-docs/adr/2607022200-com-etzhayyim-tashikame-factcheck-aozora-actor-r0.md"
   "90-docs/adr/2607022210-com-etzhayyim-kouhou-public-info-actor-r0.md"
   "orgs/etzhayyim/root/70-tools/src/etzhayyim/aozora_deploy.cljc"
   "orgs/etzhayyim/root/50-infra/murakumo/fleet.edn"
   "orgs/gftdcojp/net-kotobase/kotoba/"]
  :supersedes []
  :superseded_by []}

 :problem
 {:source "owner directive 2026-07-02 (deploy Q&A)"
  :investigated ["kotoba Rust CLI (gftdcojp/net-kotobase)" "bb murakumo:deploy / fleet:probe" "bb aozora:deploy + aozora_deploy.cljc" "bb e7m consolidation (ADR-2606222000)" "kotoba-clj WASM compiler + IdbBlockStore"]
  :gap "3 substrate CLI を『対等な deploy 先』と見做すと storage/compute/publish が混同され、aozora で actor を走らせる誤謬と CLI の乱立(e7m TS / etzhayyim-cli Go 二重化の再発)を生む"
  :risk "aozora=compute の誤謬、依存の循環、実行会場(user-WASM vs fleet)と publish 帰属の分離不明確"}

 :decision
 {:topology "3 substrate = 3 concerns (storage/compute/publish). aozora is publish-sink + identity-register, NOT compute."
  :layering "author → kotoba(storage) → {murakumo | browser-WASM}(compute) → aozora(publish). no cycles; 3 registrations independent & idempotent."
  :facets {:kotoba {:concern :storage :verb "pin" :registers "code+state by CID" :shipped-via "bb kotobase:pin / actor:mesh"}
           :murakumo {:concern :compute-resident :verb "reside" :registers "kototama (resident Pregel cell)" :shipped-via "bb murakumo:deploy --node"}
           :aozora {:concern :publish :verb "identify" :registers "did+profile+lexicon on PDS (1x)" :shipped-via "bb aozora:deploy [--apply]"}}
  :execution-venues [{:venue "browser-WASM" :mode "user-sovereign (no-server-key pure form)" :publish-signed-by "user key" :maturity :gap-wiring}
                     {:venue "murakumo kototama" :mode "communal resident (distributed inference)" :publish-signed-by "actor did + member CACAO leash" :maturity :lite-runner-live-cells-r0}]
  :unified-cli "under bb e7m (ADR-2606222000): e7m actor {mesh, pin, reside, identify, deploy --all}; rename-only of existing bb tasks, no new CLI binary"
  :aozora-1-2-3 "`e7m actor identify` (= aozora:deploy) already does (1) PDS did/profile reg, (2) LEASH member CACAO, (3) createRecord auth — ~80% shipped; gap = child-repo actor manifest wiring + owner-supplied member key"}

 :consequences
 {:isolation "3 substrates each own one concern; no cycles; aozora-deploy = identity reg (1x), runtime publish attributed by venue"
  :venues "user-WASM and fleet-kototama both materialize the same CID from kotoba, both publish to aozora; attribution differs (user vs actor+leash)"
  :reuse "lands under existing bb e7m consolidation; no new CLI binary (rename-only)"
  :gaps "{:pin-cli 'actor pin CLI not yet tidied', :kotodama-cells 'R0 scaffold', :build-wasm 'compiler+IDB exist but e7m actor build-wasm not wired', :leash 'member key is owner-supplied (no-server-key)'}"}

 :alternatives
 [{:option "treat 3 substrates as peer deploy targets"
   :rejected_because "conflates storage/compute/publish; leads to the 'run the actor on aozora' category error"}
  {:option "single unified substrate"
   :rejected_because "loses the user-sovereign-WASM vs communal-fleet dual and the CID-verifiable storage/compute split"}
  {:option "three new standalone CLI binaries (kotoba/murakumo/aozora)"
   :rejected_because "collides with bb e7m consolidation (ADR-2606222000); reproduces the e7m-TS / etzhayyim-cli-Go duplication"}]

 :honesty
 {:maturity "identify=shipped, pin/reside=partly-built/R0, browser-WASM=gap-wiring. This ADR fixes topology+ naming; per-facet depth (pin CLI, full kotodama cells, build-wasm) is follow-up."
  :outward "live aozora publish needs owner-supplied member LEASH + actor repo on PDS; design-resolved via identify, key still owner-supplied (no-server-key)."}}
